	(text "Ven = 8V\nVen = Vin * Rbot/(Rtop+Rbottom)\nRatio of Rbottom/(Rtop+Rbottom)=1.08/8≈0.135\n\nStandardized Passives:\nratio = 51.1k / (300k + 51.1k) = 0.145\n\nVin,on = 1.08 / 0.145 ≈ 7.42V\n\nVin,off = 0.92/0.131 = 7V\n\nR4 as a DNP 0 ohm resistor to force \nboost off in some cases"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
